# No all caps

Never use all caps in this repo — in UI copy, CSS, or AI-written text.

## CSS

- Do not use `text-transform: uppercase`.
- Do not add wide `letter-spacing` only to style shouted labels.

```css
/* Bad */
.kicker {
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
}

/* Good */
.kicker {
  font-family: "Henrietta Regular";
  color: var(--very-light-yellow-darker);
}
```

## HTML and content

- Write kickers, section labels, buttons, and callouts in **sentence case** or **title case**.
- Do not type labels as `ADJUST VOLUME`, `PROJECT GOALS`, etc.
- Prefer: `Adjust volume`, `Project goals`.

## When editing existing code

- If you touch a file that still uses all caps, remove the uppercase styling or rewrite the copy — do not add more.

## Exceptions

- Abbreviations and acronyms that are normally uppercase in prose: `EQ`, `UI`, `Esc` (keyboard key label).
- Third-party assets or quoted text you must not change.
